> y=range(p1$data$y, p2$data$y)
> x=range(p1$data$x, p2$data$x)
> multiplot(p1+xlim(x[1], x[2])+ylim(y[1], y[2]), p2+xlim(x[1], x[2])+ylim(y[1], y[2]), ncol=2)

will do the trick.

